For orders already settled at Datatrans the outage recovery cron ran the capture command again.
Datatrans rejects a second settle with INVALID_TRANSACTION_STATUS (already settled), which the capture
validator reports as "Multicapture feature is not supported", so is_paid was never set and the order
failed on every run. Sync the payment data from the already fetched status instead (is_paid from
detail.settle.amount) and move the order to processing without calling the Datatrans settle API.

